// Survival starts with almost nothing: stone tools (the Pickaxe), 4 torches, a little food and oil.
// You can only dig with tools you own: the drill in the hotbar still bites like a pickaxe, so granite
// (needs a drill) won't give, but dirt does. A save keeps the mode and its rules.
map
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#.........####......dddd.....#
#...@.....####......dddd.....#
##############################
end
mode survival
expect 1 mode == 1
expect 1 inv:StoneTools == 1
expect 1 inv:Torch == 4
expect 1 inv:Grub == 3
expect 1 inv:Root == 2
expect 1 inv:FungusOil == 2
expect 1 inv:WoodPillar == 0
expect 1 inv:Tnt == 0
// the drill selected, but only a pickaxe owned: the granite wall to the right holds
tool 2 2
mine 2-80 6 0
expect 80 is:6,0,Granite == 1
saveload 90
expect 91 mode == 1
expect 91 inv:StoneTools == 1
// the pickaxe digs dirt fine
mine 100-160 16 -1
expect 160 is:16,-1,Dirt == 0
